meta {
  name: List deploy links
  type: http
  seq: 47
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/deploy-links
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Your links between a repository and a monitor, server or tag, each with its newest deploy and whether you allowed redeploying its previous version from a deploy's page (`allow_redeploy`, off unless you turned it on). Pass `monitor` to list only that monitor’s own links; `deploys_connected` says whether anything can report deploys to your organization.

  Scope: `monitoring.read`
}
